{"version":2,"slug":"my-weekend-a1-a2","videoId":"2QsxCYPZ-6o","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/2QsxCYPZ-6o","lang":"en","title":"My Weekend! (A1-A2)","category":"Daily life","channel":"English Listening Practice for Beginners","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@Slow_English_Podcast","captionSource":"auto","tags":["English Conversation","learn english"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":0,"text":"Hello."},{"start":1,"text":"What did you do"},{"start":5,"text":"last weekend?"},{"start":7,"text":"Was it exciting,"},{"start":12,"text":"boring,"},{"start":14,"text":"interesting?"},{"start":15,"text":"I am going to tell you"},{"start":20,"text":"about my weekend. First, slowly."},{"start":26,"text":"Then,"},{"start":28,"text":"normally."},{"start":30,"text":"Learning English doesn't have to be"},{"start":34,"text":"difficult or complicated."},{"start":38,"text":"It can be"},{"start":40,"text":"easy."},{"start":41,"text":"Over the weekend,"},{"start":44,"text":"I took the bus"},{"start":47,"text":"to my parents' house, my mom and my dad."},{"start":55,"text":"They both live"},{"start":57,"text":"together"},{"start":59,"text":"with my little brother,"},{"start":62,"text":"Joaquin."},{"start":64,"text":"He edits these videos."},{"start":68,"text":"I decided to visit my parents"},{"start":73,"text":"last minute,"},{"start":76,"text":"around"},{"start":240,"text":"p.m."},{"start":240.6,"text":"But, at"},{"start":241.2,"text":"p.m.,"},{"start":241.8,"text":"the traffic"},{"start":242.4,"text":"in Mexico City"},{"start":243,"text":"is crazy."},{"start":243.6,"text":"So, I decided to wait"},{"start":244.2,"text":"for the traffic to settle down."},{"start":244.8,"text":"Traffic never settles down in Mexico"},{"start":245.4,"text":"City,"},{"start":246,"text":"but"},{"start":246.6,"text":"around"},{"start":480,"text":"p.m.,"},{"start":480.6,"text":"it's not too crazy"},{"start":481.2,"text":"anymore."},{"start":481.8,"text":"But, there was still so much traffic. I"},{"start":482.4,"text":"was sat"},{"start":483,"text":"in traffic"},{"start":483.6,"text":"for about"},{"start":484.2,"text":"2 hours."},{"start":484.8,"text":"And then,"},{"start":485.4,"text":"he finally started driving."},{"start":486,"text":"He drove all the way to my hometown,"},{"start":486.6,"text":"where my dad"},{"start":487.2,"text":"picked me up"},{"start":487.8,"text":"in his car."},{"start":488.4,"text":"He drove his car to the bus station,"},{"start":489,"text":"and he picked me up."},{"start":489.6,"text":"I hopped in,"},{"start":490.2,"text":"and I sat in the front seat"},{"start":490.8,"text":"of the car."},{"start":491.4,"text":"Not the back seat."},{"start":492,"text":"The front seat."},{"start":492.6,"text":"[laughter and gasps]"},{"start":493.2,"text":"Because my mom wasn't there."},{"start":493.8,"text":"So, I got to sit"},{"start":494.4,"text":"in the front seat."},{"start":495,"text":"[laughter]"},{"start":495.6,"text":"I was a little hungry"},{"start":496.2,"text":"because I hadn't had"},{"start":496.8,"text":"any dinner"},{"start":497.4,"text":"yet."},{"start":498,"text":"So, my dad drove me to get some"},{"start":498.6,"text":"esquites."},{"start":499.2,"text":"Esquites have corn,"},{"start":499.8,"text":"mayonnaise,"},{"start":500.4,"text":"lime,"},{"start":501,"text":"tajin."},{"start":501.6,"text":"It's a mixture of good stuff."},{"start":502.2,"text":"It's the perfect late-night"},{"start":502.8,"text":"snack."},{"start":503.4,"text":"We bought two esquites."},{"start":504,"text":"One for me,"},{"start":504.6,"text":"and one for my mom."},{"start":505.2,"text":"And we drove home."},{"start":505.8,"text":"We ate our esquites"},{"start":506.4,"text":"and we hung out"},{"start":507,"text":"listening to music,"},{"start":507.6,"text":"watching videos,"},{"start":508.2,"text":"and the next morning"},{"start":508.8,"text":"we all went to the cafe"},{"start":509.4,"text":"where they sell breakfast,"},{"start":510,"text":"coffee."},{"start":510.6,"text":"You can sit down"},{"start":511.2,"text":"and chat"},{"start":511.8,"text":"with friends or family"},{"start":512.4,"text":"while you eat breakfast."},{"start":513,"text":"I ordered a maple donut"},{"start":513.6,"text":"with bacon."},{"start":514.2,"text":"Mhm."},{"start":514.8,"text":"[laughter]"},{"start":515.4,"text":"That was the perfect combination."},{"start":516,"text":"Maple"},{"start":516.6,"text":"with bacon. So good."},{"start":517.2,"text":"The donut was fluffy"},{"start":517.8,"text":"and soft,"},{"start":518.4,"text":"but"},{"start":519,"text":"crunchy"},{"start":519.6,"text":"on the outside."},{"start":520.2,"text":"Mhm."},{"start":520.8,"text":"I also ordered a omelette"},{"start":521.4,"text":"with spinach and I ordered a cappuccino."},{"start":522,"text":"My dad drove us all back home"},{"start":522.6,"text":"and we watched a movie"},{"start":523.2,"text":"called Roommates"},{"start":523.8,"text":"on Netflix."},{"start":524.4,"text":"It was really good."},{"start":525,"text":"It's one of those movies"},{"start":525.6,"text":"that keeps you"},{"start":526.2,"text":"on your toes."},{"start":526.8,"text":"Just uh"},{"start":527.4,"text":"waiting for the next thing to happen. It"},{"start":528,"text":"wasn't suspenseful"},{"start":528.6,"text":"or scary."},{"start":529.2,"text":"It was"},{"start":529.8,"text":"just frustrating and just uh"},{"start":530.4,"text":"[sighs and gasps]"},{"start":531,"text":"annoying to see"},{"start":531.6,"text":"how her roommate"},{"start":532.2,"text":"got away with everything"},{"start":532.8,"text":"again and again. But,"},{"start":533.4,"text":"it was really good. Later,"},{"start":534,"text":"my dad drove me to my nail appointment."},{"start":534.6,"text":"As you can see, I got my nails done"},{"start":535.2,"text":"again."},{"start":535.8,"text":"[laughter]"},{"start":536.4,"text":"I used to never get my nails done,"},{"start":537,"text":"but lately with my videos"},{"start":537.6,"text":"and my rings,"},{"start":538.2,"text":"I really love looking down"},{"start":538.8,"text":"while I'm working"},{"start":539.4,"text":"[gasps]"},{"start":540,"text":"and seeing my nails and saying,"},{"start":540.6,"text":"\"Those are cute nails.\""},{"start":541.2,"text":"I chatted and I gossiped with the nail"},{"start":541.8,"text":"technician."},{"start":542.4,"text":"And I loved my nails. Do you like them?"},{"start":543,"text":"Same as do you like them?"},{"start":543.6,"text":"But, quickly,"},{"start":544.2,"text":"do you like them?"},{"start":544.8,"text":"I decided on the color pink."},{"start":545.4,"text":"I don't know if pink is really my color,"},{"start":546,"text":"but lately,"},{"start":546.6,"text":"I've been really obsessed"},{"start":547.2,"text":"with pink."},{"start":547.8,"text":"I just bought a new purse"},{"start":548.4,"text":"with pink"},{"start":549,"text":"polka dots."},{"start":549.6,"text":"These are polka dots."},{"start":550.2,"text":"[snorts and gasps]"},{"start":550.8,"text":"So, I thought,"},{"start":551.4,"text":"\"I think pink nails"},{"start":552,"text":"would go well"},{"start":552.6,"text":"with my new bag.\""},{"start":553.2,"text":"You know what I mean?"},{"start":553.8,"text":"That's something I noticed"},{"start":554.4,"text":"I say a lot."},{"start":555,"text":"Native speakers say it a lot."},{"start":555.6,"text":"Do you know what I mean?"},{"start":556.2,"text":"Kind of to reaffirm"},{"start":556.8,"text":"that you understand."},{"start":557.4,"text":"So, if I say"},{"start":558,"text":"\"Yeah, I got"},{"start":558.6,"text":"my pink nails"},{"start":559.2,"text":"because they match my new bag."},{"start":559.8,"text":"And pink"},{"start":560.4,"text":"is just a pretty color.\""},{"start":561,"text":"Do you know what I mean?"},{"start":561.6,"text":"You know what I mean?"},{"start":562.2,"text":"Do you know what I mean?"},{"start":562.8,"text":"That's something you could use"},{"start":563.4,"text":"just if you want to make sure"},{"start":564,"text":"that somebody understands"},{"start":564.6,"text":"your point,"},{"start":565.2,"text":"your idea."},{"start":565.8,"text":"You know what I mean?"},{"start":566.4,"text":"After my nail appointment,"},{"start":567,"text":"I had some lunch with my mom."},{"start":567.6,"text":"And I took the bus back to my apartment."},{"start":568.2,"text":"I took a shower"},{"start":568.8,"text":"and I got ready"},{"start":569.4,"text":"because I had a techno event to go to."},{"start":570,"text":"Just an event"},{"start":570.6,"text":"where they play techno music. I did my"},{"start":571.2,"text":"makeup."},{"start":571.8,"text":"I put some eye shadow on, some lip"},{"start":572.4,"text":"gloss, and some cute earrings."},{"start":573,"text":"By the way,"},{"start":573.6,"text":"do you want me to make my next video"},{"start":574.2,"text":"about makeup?"},{"start":574.8,"text":"The vocabulary,"},{"start":575.4,"text":"the steps"},{"start":576,"text":"in simple English?"},{"start":576.6,"text":"Let me know. I went to the techno event"},{"start":577.2,"text":"and I danced all night."},{"start":577.8,"text":"And the next morning"},{"start":579,"text":"I got breakfast at Toks. Toks is a chain"},{"start":584,"text":"of restaurants."},{"start":586,"text":"It's very popular in Mexico."},{"start":590,"text":"Do you have any restaurant chains in"},{"start":594,"text":"your country? If so,"},{"start":596,"text":"which one is your favorite?"},{"start":599,"text":"And why?"},{"start":601,"text":"I slept all a day"},{"start":603,"text":"and then I went with my sister"},{"start":607,"text":"to walk around some cute bazaars"},{"start":612,"text":"and markets in Mexico City."},{"start":615,"text":"And I bought"},{"start":617,"text":"this necklace."},{"start":620,"text":"It's my favorite flower."},{"start":623,"text":"The jacarandas."},{"start":624,"text":"And they made it a necklace."},{"start":628,"text":"I love it."},{"start":630,"text":"It's my new favorite necklace."},{"start":633,"text":"I also recorded a few videos for the"},{"start":638,"text":"week. I worked on my English community."},{"start":642,"text":"And then"},{"start":643,"text":"I went to sleep again."},{"start":647,"text":"It was a really special weekend."},{"start":651,"text":"I saw family, friends"},{"start":654,"text":"and I spent time with myself. What about"},{"start":658,"text":"you?"},{"start":659,"text":"What did you do this weekend?"},{"start":663,"text":"You know what I mean?"},{"start":666,"text":"Try and integrate this phrase into a"},{"start":669,"text":"sentence you use today."},{"start":673,"text":"It's a fun phrase to use."},{"start":676,"text":"I think."},{"start":677,"text":"Now, here goes the normal speed."},{"start":681,"text":"So,"},{"start":682,"text":"over the weekend I took the bus to my"},{"start":684,"text":"parents' house."},{"start":685,"text":"My mom and my dad."},{"start":688,"text":"But my dad was the only one who picked"},{"start":690,"text":"me up at the bus station. We chatted in"},{"start":694,"text":"the car for a little bit"},{"start":695,"text":"and I was a little hungry because I"},{"start":697,"text":"hadn't had anything for dinner."},{"start":701,"text":"So, he took me to get some esquites."},{"start":704,"text":"An esquite is a mixture of corn,"},{"start":707,"text":"mayonnaise, lime,"},{"start":709,"text":"tajín, sometimes cheese,"},{"start":712,"text":"but I don't eat that much cheese because"},{"start":715,"text":"it's bad for my acne."},{"start":717,"text":"We all hung out, we ate esquites"},{"start":719,"text":"together, and we listened to music and"},{"start":723,"text":"watched YouTube videos."},{"start":725,"text":"Next day, we went to my favorite cafe in"},{"start":727,"text":"my hometown and I ordered the most"},{"start":730,"text":"delicious donut. It was a maple donut"},{"start":733,"text":"with sprinkles of bacon on top."},{"start":736,"text":"The bacon wasn't too crispy or too"},{"start":739,"text":"soggy. It was perfect. And so was the"},{"start":743,"text":"donut. The donut was fluffy and soft on"},{"start":745,"text":"the inside, but the outer layer was"},{"start":748,"text":"crunchy where the maple was."},{"start":750,"text":"It was really good. I also ordered an"},{"start":753,"text":"omelet with spinach"},{"start":755,"text":"and I had a cappuccino coffee. Then my"},{"start":758,"text":"dad drove us home and we watched a movie"},{"start":760,"text":"on Netflix called Roommates. It's really"},{"start":763,"text":"good, but it just keeps you on your"},{"start":765,"text":"toes. It keeps you kind of on the edge"},{"start":767,"text":"of your seat because like what's going"},{"start":770,"text":"to happen next? What's she going to do"},{"start":772,"text":"to her next? It was a little frustrating"},{"start":774,"text":"to watch, but really interesting. Then"},{"start":777,"text":"my dad drove me to my nail appointment."},{"start":780,"text":"I got my nails done and I chatted and"},{"start":784,"text":"gossiped with my nail technician. I got"},{"start":786,"text":"pink to match some accessories that I've"},{"start":788,"text":"been buying. I just bought this brown"},{"start":790,"text":"purse with pink polka dots and I thought"},{"start":793,"text":"that my nails would match it perfectly."},{"start":796,"text":"After that, I took my bus back to my"},{"start":798,"text":"apartment and I rushed to take a quick"},{"start":800,"text":"shower. I did some quick makeup,"},{"start":803,"text":"eyeshadow, put on some cute earrings,"},{"start":806,"text":"and I head to a techno event with my"},{"start":808,"text":"friends."},{"start":809,"text":"We danced all night, and then we had"},{"start":811,"text":"breakfast together at Toks."},{"start":813,"text":"It's a chain of restaurants in Mexico"},{"start":815,"text":"that's very popular, and I think I"},{"start":817,"text":"ordered some enchiladas suizas."},{"start":820,"text":"If you've never had enchiladas suizas"},{"start":821,"text":"before, if you ever go to Mexico, you"},{"start":824,"text":"need to try them. They're so good. Um"},{"start":826,"text":"but I'm curious, do you have any"},{"start":828,"text":"restaurant chains in your country? And"},{"start":831,"text":"if so, which one is your favorite? It"},{"start":834,"text":"was a really fun weekend, and I'm"},{"start":836,"text":"curious, what did you do this weekend?"},{"start":840,"text":"If you enjoyed this video, be sure to"},{"start":842,"text":"like it and subscribe so you can"},{"start":845,"text":"continue to learn English"},{"start":848,"text":"easily. English doesn't need to be"},{"start":852,"text":"boring or frustrating."},{"start":854,"text":"Learning a language can be fun."},{"start":858,"text":"It can be easy."},{"start":860,"text":"So subscribe to continue learning"},{"start":862,"text":"English with me. And if you liked this"},{"start":864,"text":"video, I'm sure you'll like these two"},{"start":867,"text":"that I made just for you."},{"start":870,"text":"And remember,"},{"start":871,"text":"never stop learning."},{"start":875,"text":"Bye."}]}